      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-04-18_WidnesExaminer_art0165" n="art0165">
        <head>TRADES AND LABOUR COUNCIL.</head>
        <p>TRADES AND LABOUR COUNCIL.</p>
        <p>Municipal Coal.</p>
